      "lines": [
        "$\\ldots,\\ 10^{-2},\\ 10^{-1},\\ 10^0,\\ 10^1,\\ 10^2,\\ 10^3,\\ \\ldots$。 （4）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "比较数列（3）和（4），很自然地取 $10^{-1}$ 等于 $\\frac{1}{10}$，$10^{-2}$ 等于",
        "$\\frac{1}{100}$，等等。在数学中，这样的规定不仅适用于10的幂，而且",
        "也适用于不为零的任何数的幂。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定义 $a^n=\\frac{1}{a^{-n}}$，其中 $a\\ne0$，$n\\in Z$，且 $n<0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，$10^{-4}=\\frac{1}{10^4}$，$3^{-8}=\\frac{1}{3^8}$，$\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{-3}=\\frac{1}{\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^3}$。",
        "象 $0^{-3}$ 这样的写法（一般地，零的负数幂）没有意义。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们回到本小节开头所举的例子。现在已经很清楚，表",
        "示氢原子质量的写法 $1.674\\cdot10^{-24}$（以克为单位）就是：",
        "$1.674\\cdot\\frac{1}{10^{24}}=\\frac{1.674}{10^{24}}=0.\\underbrace{00\\cdots01674}$。",
        "小数点后27位"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "135",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
